OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1785790070
OL,3,CEast Midlands Railway staff begin
OL,4,Cstrike action over 'unsafe' Aurora
OL,5,Ctrains
OL,7,FStaff from East Midlands Railway have
OL,8,Fbegun their planned strike action
OL,9,Foutside Derby and Nottingham railway
OL,10,Fstations because of ongoing concerns
OL,11,Fover the safety of some of its trains.
OL,13,FThe National Union of Rail, Maritime
OL,14,Fand Transport Workers (RMT) organised
OL,15,Fstrikes across the country on Saturday
OL,16,Ffollowing the rollout of its Class 810
OL,17,FAurora fleet, which staff say has been
OL,18,Foperating with a "significant" number
OL,19,Fof "dangerous faults".
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1785790070
OL,3,CEast Midlands Railway staff begin
OL,4,Cstrike action over 'unsafe' Aurora
OL,5,Ctrains
OL,7,FStrikes will continue on 8 and 15
OL,8,FAugust.
OL,10,FIssues raised by the union include
OL,11,Fdrivers and staff being forced to work
OL,12,Fin 40C heat during the recent
OL,13,Fheatwaves, due to faulty air
OL,14,Fconditioning, and passengers being
OL,15,Funable to access toilets - but one
OL,16,Ffrightening fault which leaves trains
OL,17,Fsitting like "dead ducks" on railway
OL,18,Ftracks has been described as
OL,19,F"completely unsafe".
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1785790070
OL,3,CEast Midlands Railway staff begin
OL,4,Cstrike action over 'unsafe' Aurora
OL,5,Ctrains
OL,7,FKeir Chewings, who is the Midlands
OL,8,Fmember on the RMT's national executive
OL,9,Fcommittee, said: "There's a fault at
OL,10,Fthe moment that is causing these
OL,11,Ftrains to require a reset.
OL,13,F"When they do this reset, whether
OL,14,Fthey're on a platform or in the middle
OL,15,Fof nowhere, they have to do a hard
OL,16,Freset on these trains, which turns
OL,17,Fabsolutely everything off.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1785790070
OL,3,CEast Midlands Railway staff begin
OL,4,Cstrike action over 'unsafe' Aurora
OL,5,Ctrains
OL,7,F"All power, all safety systems, gone.
OL,8,FNo communication to the signal. They
OL,9,Fare literally a dead duck in the
OL,10,Fmiddle of nowhere. And that is for
OL,11,Fabout 20 minutes.
OL,13,FHe added: "We've then got members of
OL,14,Fstaff being forced to work in 40-plus
OL,15,Fdegrees because they've got inadequate
OL,16,Fair conditioning systems."
OL,18,F"It's not like we're striking over pay
OL,19,For conditions. This is purely about
OL,20,Fsafety, and that is quite clear, and
OL,21,Feveryone is actually behind us.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1785790070
OL,3,CEast Midlands Railway staff begin
OL,4,Cstrike action over 'unsafe' Aurora
OL,5,Ctrains
OL,7,FIn addition to the three days of
OL,8,Fstrike action, members will also be
OL,9,Ftaking Action of Short Strike, from
OL,10,FSunday 2 August to Friday 7 August,
OL,11,Fand from Sunday 9 August to Friday 14
OL,12,FAugust.
OL,14,FTrains may be subject to short-notice
OL,15,Fchanges and cancellations, and
OL,16,Fpassengers are being advised to check
OL,17,Ffor delays and alterations before they
OL,18,Ftravel.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1785790070
OL,3,CEast Midlands Railway staff begin
OL,4,Cstrike action over 'unsafe' Aurora
OL,5,Ctrains
OL,7,FEast Midlands Railway has apologised
OL,8,Fto customers affected by the
OL,9,Findustrial action, and said any claims
OL,10,Fsuggesting the trains do not meet the
OL,11,Fsafety standards are "incorrect".
OL,13,FPhilippa Cresswell, customer
OL,14,Fexperience director at EMR, said: "We
OL,15,Fknow the disruption this will cause
OL,16,Fand are advising customers to only
OL,17,Ftravel if their journey is essential
OL,18,Fon Saturday 1, 8 and 15 August, as we
OL,19,Fwill be operating a significantly
OL,20,Freduced timetable between 7am and 7pm.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1785790070
OL,3,CEast Midlands Railway staff begin
OL,4,Cstrike action over 'unsafe' Aurora
OL,5,Ctrains
OL,7,F"EMR continues to engage in
OL,8,Fconstructive discussions with the RMT
OL,9,Fin the hope of resolving this dispute
OL,10,Fas quickly as possible.
OL,12,F"The dispute relates to concerns
OL,13,Fraised about the introduction of our
OL,14,Fnew Class 810 Aurora fleet.
OL,16,F"Any suggestion that the trains do not
OL,17,Fmeet the required safety standards is
OL,18,Fincorrect.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1785790070
OL,3,CEast Midlands Railway staff begin
OL,4,Cstrike action over 'unsafe' Aurora
OL,5,Ctrains
OL,7,F"The Class 810 fleet entered passenger
OL,8,Fservice only after successfully
OL,9,Fcompleting all required testing and
OL,10,Fmeeting the rigorous safety standards
OL,11,Frequired by the independent regulator."
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G8/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
